  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%A7%80%EA%B8%88%EC%9D%80-37.2%EB%8F%84/3181), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60952929)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nJapanese: [Comico](https://www.comico.jp/comic/7161), [Piccoma](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/174242)\n\n 'What was the senior's mind..?'  Chaeeun didn't want to admit it.  Surely he used to smile kindly in front of her and look at her with loving eyes, but now it's just 'acquaintance'.  Wasn't we... riding some?  Chae-eun falls into despair as her relationship with her senior is shaken, and Chae-eun's motive, Ji-woo, becomes more and more concerned about Chae-eun.  And when Jin-seong, who had unrequited love for Chae-eun, couldn't win Chae-eun's heart, he tried to use Chae-eun's friend who liked him to satisfy her desire... Different heart temperatures, misunderstandings and illusions unfolding in them.  and mixed relationships.  The more they try to escape, the more intertwined romance begins.",
